## Manual override map (optional — not the default path)

| User says | Meaning | Arm after success |
|-----------|---------|-------------------|
| **PR** (EMAIL non-transfer; LF already auto-done) | Paste reply only | **`--arm`** then **`--await-arm`** |
| **PR LF** / **pr lf** | PR then LF (if Auto-LF missed) then Anwenden arm | **`--arm`** |
| **LF** alone (EMAIL) | Fill tracker only | Arm only if closing out without PR and non-transfer → **`--arm`** |
| **LF** alone (**CALL**) | Voice LF | **`--arm-next`** |
| **LF TR** (+ optional target) | Transfer Ja fill | **`--arm-weiter`** / **`--arm-extern`** |

- Never mix Anwenden / Next / Weiter / Extern arms.  
- **CALL** → never Anwenden `--arm` after voice LF.  
- Transfer → never Anwenden; never PR unless user asks for a reply.

